:"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞の意味を改めて感じながら皆さんに何か少しでも伝えたい！と思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー1人1人の思いはその子にしか表現できないことであって、その思いを受けとめてくれて支えてくれてるファンの方が居てくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"裏で支えてくれるスタッフさんが居てくれる。みんなの思いが沢山詰まったライブになったんじゃないかなと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回こうして15thシングルのみんなと一緒にステージに立ててとても幸せでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のツアーを通してあらためて感じる事や感謝することも沢山ありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見に来てくださった皆さんもタオルや団扇！Ｔシャツ！沢山見えましたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前も沢山叫んでくれてありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花もすごく嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝してもしきれません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと恩返しできるように頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの素敵なお花をありがとうございます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてらんぜ〜ハッピーバースデー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの大好きな大好きならんぜ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はアンコール前のステージ裏でおしりをポンポンっとされて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなって誰がしたんだろ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思ったららんぜだったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもまあやさんまあやさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくれる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハの最後のお片づけの時とからんぜの邪魔してたら次の日はらんぜがまあやの邪魔してきたりと‥笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度ご飯行く約束もしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやくいこーねー❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな可愛いらんぜはまあやのお膝の中にいるよ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日のRの法則ではmiwaさんがゲストで来てくださって、もともと好きだったのですが歌声や、今回のNコンのお話とか聞いてるさらに好きになりました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その日に沢山曲入れました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネイルは秋カラー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天のときの♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織が素敵なネイルしてて、いいな〜って思って買ったんだ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は横浜で握手会だ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気をつけて来てください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな服を着ようかな( › ·̮ ‹ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キッチンでお料理するといつも汗かいちゃう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見えるかな？うっすら汗かいてるの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、今回のライブに来てくれたファンの方、応援のメッセージをくれた方、家族やお友達、裏で支えてくださったスタッフさん、そしてメンバーに 感謝します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足りない所ばかりの私をいつも支えてくれてありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも笑顔を届けられる自分になれるよう努力していきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木坂46の「の」が放送だよ( › ·̮ ‹ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてレギュラー番組のぎ英語も、そしてのぎゴルフも見てね〜( › ·̮ ‹ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこの前まあやはゴルフ絶好調でした( › ·̮ ‹ )片山プロにもゴルゴさんにも沢山褒められたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに〜(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/09/25/7905116/0016.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}